  "title": "Zen Principle Naturals Recalls Moringa Capsules Over Possible Salmonella Contamination",
  "summary": "A dietary supplement sold across the United States has been recalled after concerns about possible Salmonella contamination. Zen Principle Naturals has voluntarily recalled a specific batch of its Moringa Capsules after an ingredient supplier notified the company that raw moringa leaf powder tested positive for the harmful bacteria. The recall adds to a growing list of moringa related product recalls in recent months, raising fresh concerns about ingredient safety and quality control within the",
